{"sid": "s27", "voice": "female", "total_duration": 71.76, "segments": [{"para": 0, "start": 0.0, "duration": 1.88, "text": "高上玉皇心印妙经"}, {"para": 1, "start": 1.88, "duration": 3.6, "text": "上药三品，神与气精。"}, {"para": 2, "start": 5.49, "duration": 3.08, "text": "恍恍惚惚，杳杳冥冥。"}, {"para": 3, "start": 8.57, "duration": 2.38, "text": "存无守有，顷刻而成。"}, {"para": 4, "start": 10.95, "duration": 3.08, "text": "回风混合，百日功灵。"}, {"para": 5, "start": 14.03, "duration": 2.66, "text": "默朝上帝，一纪飞升。"}, {"para": 6, "start": 16.69, "duration": 2.72, "text": "知者易悟，昧者难行。"}, {"para": 7, "start": 19.41, "duration": 2.38, "text": "履踐天光，呼吸育清。"}, {"para": 8, "start": 21.79, "duration": 3.13, "text": "出玄入牝，若亡若存。"}, {"para": 9, "start": 24.92, "duration": 2.06, "text": "绵绵不绝，固蒂根深。"}, {"para": 10, "start": 26.98, "duration": 2.56, "text": "人各有精，精合其神。"}, {"para": 11, "start": 29.54, "duration": 2.9, "text": "神合其气，气合其真。"}, {"para": 12, "start": 32.44, "duration": 2.56, "text": "不得其真，皆是强名。"}, {"para": 13, "start": 35.0, "duration": 2.56, "text": "神能入石，神能飞形。"}, {"para": 14, "start": 37.56, "duration": 2.48, "text": "入水不溺，入火不焚。"}, {"para": 15, "start": 40.04, "duration": 2.3, "text": "神依形生，精依气盈。"}, {"para": 16, "start": 42.34, "duration": 3.27, "text": "不凋不残，松柏青青。"}, {"para": 17, "start": 45.61, "duration": 2.56, "text": "三品一理，妙不可听。"}, {"para": 18, "start": 48.17, "duration": 2.72, "text": "其聚则有，其散则零。"}, {"para": 19, "start": 50.88, "duration": 2.48, "text": "七窍相通，窍窍光明。"}, {"para": 20, "start": 53.37, "duration": 2.56, "text": "圣日圣月，照耀金庭。"}, {"para": 21, "start": 55.93, "duration": 2.48, "text": "一得永得，自然身轻。"}, {"para": 22, "start": 58.41, "duration": 2.25, "text": "太和充溢，骨散寒琼。"}, {"para": 23, "start": 60.65, "duration": 2.66, "text": "得丹则灵，不得则倾。"}, {"para": 24, "start": 63.32, "duration": 3.03, "text": "丹在心中，非白非青。"}, {"para": 25, "start": 66.35, "duration": 2.38, "text": "诵之万遍，妙理自明。"}, {"para": 26, "start": 68.73, "duration": 3.03, "text": "高上玉皇心印妙经卷终"}]}